# Who reviews what. GitHub asks the owners of every file a pull request touches; the last matching line wins.
#
# Adding a vendor maintainer: give them write access (or add them to a team that has it), then add a line per vendor folder, for example
#   /vendors/misumi/     @maintainer @vendor-maintainer
# A maintainer of one series or one generator gets a longer path: /vendors/misumi/hfs/extrusion/ .
# Turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection of main to make the review binding.
